:name: S.T.A.R. AOS frame check on a simulated LEON3 (SPARC V8)
:description: loads star_aos_leon3.elf on Renode's leon3 board, logs the APBUART to a file, runs 2 s of virtual time

mach create "leon3"
machine LoadPlatformDescription @platforms/boards/leon3.repl
sysbus LoadELF $elf
# act as the boot loader: BCC2 detects end-of-RAM from the initial stack pointer (BCC manual 2.10); Renode sets none
cpu SetRegister 14 0x41000000
uart CreateFileBackend $out true
emulation RunFor "2"
quit
